INT. STUDIO - NIGHT
VISUAL SETUP: Warm neutral studio backdrop uses var(--paper); the display surround uses var(--card). Soft neutral lighting; restrained var(--accent) detail on the display. ANCHOR retains the same var(--ink-2) jacket throughout.
ANCHOR stands beside a display.
ANCHOR
The new route connects the station and hospital after midnight.

VISUAL THEME & COLOUR GUIDE
Mode: light. Warm neutral layers with a rare orange focal accent.
Clothing: ANCHOR — var(--ink-2) jacket, consistent in every shot.
Objects: Display — var(--card) surround, var(--ink) text, var(--line) dividers.
Location: Studio — var(--paper) backdrop, var(--sunken) recessed panels; retain layout across cuts.
Lighting: Soft neutral illumination; preserve palette relationships and avoid coloured light spills.
Overlays: var(--ink) text on var(--card); use var(--accent) for the single primary highlight.
Palette: Light-mode declarations; all styling references these variables.
:root {
  --paper: #F5F3EE;
  --card: #FFFFFF;
  --sunken: #EFECE4;
  --popover: #FFFFFF;
  --hover: #F0EDE5;
  --scrim: rgba(31,30,27,.40);
  --line: #E3DFD5;
  --line-strong: #CFCABD;
  --ink: #1F1E1B;
  --ink-2: #6B675F;
  --ink-3: #9A958A;
  --on-accent: #FFFFFF;
  --accent: #E0692A;
  --accent-hover: #C9581D;
  --accent-tint: #F8E6DA;
  --danger: #B3382C;
  --danger-tint: #F7E4E1;
  --success: #3F7D58;
  --success-tint: #E3F0E8;
  --warning: #A8741A;
  --warning-tint: #F7ECD6;
}
